{"id":"johnsons-rtw","title":"Around the world two-up: Grant and Susan Johnson","who":"Grant & Susan Johnson","when":"1987–1998","vehicle":"BMW R80G/S, two-up","kind":"moto","color":"#0f766e","summary":"A Canadian couple sell everything and set off for Panama on a new BMW R80G/S. Eleven years, 39 countries and more than 100,000 km later, travelling slowly, they had ridden round the world; near the end, in 1997, they founded Horizons Unlimited, now the biggest community of motorcycle travellers.","sources":[{"label":"Horizons Unlimited: Grant and Susan Johnson","url":"https://www.horizonsunlimited.com/johnson"},{"label":"Horizons Unlimited: highlights of our 11-year trip","url":"https://www.horizonsunlimited.com/johnson/hilites/"},{"label":"ADVrider: meet Grant Johnson, founder of Horizons Unlimited","url":"https://www.advrider.com/meet-grant-johnson-founder-of-horizons-unlimited/"}],"approximate":"Only places their own highlights pages name; most of the route between them is not known here and is drawn as dashed lines.","km":78157,"bbox":[-176.5719,-57.3666,179.7362,61.2163],"stops":[{"name":"Canada","place":"Vancouver, Canada","at":[49.2609,-123.114],"text":"Early 1987: everything sold, jobs quit, heading south."},{"name":"Mulegé, Baja","place":"Mulegé, Baja California Sur","at":[26.8913,-111.9826],"date":"1987","text":"El Requesón beach in Baja California, an early favourite."},{"name":"Panama","place":"Panama City","at":[8.9824,-79.5199],"text":"Their first goal, Panama."},{"name":"Uluru","place":"Uluru, Northern Territory","at":[-25.3456,131.037],"date":"1991","text":"Ayers Rock, in the middle of Australia.","by":"unknown"},{"name":"Norway","place":"Oslo, Norway","at":[59.9133,10.739],"date":"1997","text":"Norway, on the European leg.","by":"unknown"},{"name":"Tanzania","place":"Arusha, Tanzania","at":[-3.3697,36.6881],"date":"1997","text":"East Africa.","by":"unknown"},{"name":"Malawi","place":"Lilongwe, Malawi","at":[-13.9875,33.7681],"text":"South through Malawi."},{"name":"Namibia","place":"Windhoek, Namibia","at":[-22.5336,17.0455],"text":"Namibia's deserts."},{"name":"Cape Agulhas","place":"Cape Agulhas, South Africa","at":[-34.8333,19.9999],"text":"The southern tip of Africa."},{"name":"Ushuaia","place":"Ushuaia, Argentina","at":[-54.8073,-68.3084],"date":"1997","text":"Where they founded Horizons Unlimited as the trip neared its end.","by":"unknown"},{"name":"Peru","place":"Cusco, Peru","at":[-13.5171,-71.9785],"date":"1998","text":"North up the Andes."},{"name":"Ecuador","place":"Quito, Ecuador","at":[-0.2202,-78.5123],"date":"1998","text":"Ecuador."},{"name":"Alaska","place":"Anchorage, Alaska","at":[61.2163,-149.8949],"date":"1998","text":"Alaska, after eleven years on the road.","by":"unknown"}],"legs":[{"by":"ride","km":3275,"line":[[49.2611,-123.1139],[49.2102,-123.1173],[49.205,-123.1301],[49.1704,-123.0872],[49.1311,-123.0867],[49.1108,-123.0623],[49.0905,-123.0018],[49.0877,-122.8415],[49.0286,-122.7668],[48.9981,-122.7532],[48.8877,-122.5906],[48.858,-122.587],[48.7931,-122.5249],[48.7724,-122.4644],[48.7041,-122.476],[48.6873,-122.3974],[48.6657,-122.3733],[48.5952,-122.3441],[48.5362,-122.3538],[48.4982,-122.3356],[48.332,-122.3338],[48.1766,-122.1935],[47.9999,-122.1741],[47.9669,-122.199],[47.9323,-122.1965],[47.8959,-122.2169],[47.8293,-122.265],[47.8019,-122.3137],[47.7542,-122.3303],[47.5596,-122.3219],[47.4902,-122.2646],[47.2736,-122.3145],[47.2418,-122.3391],[47.2301,-122.4616],[47.1757,-122.4673],[47.1104,-122.5716],[47.0338,-122.8907],[46.7964,-123.0106],[46.7365,-122.9754],[46.6569,-122.9774],[46.6082,-122.9091],[46.565,-122.877],[46.4091,-122.8896],[46.3181,-122.9152],[46.254,-122.8842],[46.1723,-122.9048],[46.1299,-122.8989],[46.0893,-122.87],[45.9981,-122.842],[45.8704,-122.7095],[45.7964,-122.6772],[45.7121,-122.6531],[45.6366,-122.6623],[45.5975,-122.6846],[45.5223,-122.6656],[45.4708,-122.6779],[45.4386,-122.7439],[45.2787,-122.7709],[45.0736,-122.9596],[44.9976,-123.0007],[44.8998,-122